    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Redesign for a User\r\n\r\nExamine this course portal web application and review the User Persona below.\r\n\r\nWork with AI to implement one accessibility fix that would help the user to interact with the app better.\r\n\r\n## User Persona\r\nAvery, Age 16 — color-vision deficiency + light sensitivity\r\n\r\n Struggles with pale text and color-only cues\r\n \r\n Does best with a dark theme or strong contrast and labels/icons that don’t rely on color alone.\r\n \r\n Helps: Contrast; Image Alternatives (overlays/labels).\r\n",
